    "backstory": "Hatched in the radioactive glow of Subchain City, Specter's early life was marked by survival in the crumbling Bldg Cold Meano Vinos district. There, scavenging for DRIP amidst the ruins, he discovered a knack for disappearing into the shadows, becoming a phantom-like entity feared by rival flocks.",
